  "bio": "Nicky is a highly skilled custom tattoo artist specializing in illustrative, watercolor, and fineline styles at Nightchild Tattoo in Munich, Germany. Their attention to detail and ability to bring clients' visions to life with vibrant colors and intricate lines are unparalleled. Currently booking sessions from January to April 2023, Nicky is dedicated to providing outstanding artistry to each client that walks into their studio.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Munich, Bavaria, Germany\n\nCustom tattoo artist based in Munich 🇩🇪  \nWatercolor • Illustrative • Abstract  \n📩 tattooer.nicky@gmail.com \nCurrently booking May/June 2026",
